SUMMARY:Princeton in Latin America Fellowship - Application Deadline
DESCRIPTION:Princeton in Latin America (PiLA) partners with NGOs and mult
 ilateral organizations and places highly qualified recent college gradua
 tes (graduating students) in year-long service fellowships with nonprofi
 t\, public service\, humanitarian\, and government organizations in Lati
 n America and Caribbean. Apply by November 1\, 2026 at 11:59 p.m.\nhttps
 ://careerdevelopment.princeton.edu/events/princeton-latin-america-fellow
 ship-application-deadline
URL:https://careerdevelopment.princeton.edu/events/princeton-latin-americ
 a-fellowship-application-deadline
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
