LOCATION:Frist Campus Center - MPR A&B
DESCRIPTION:This program will be led by Peer Career Advisers (PCAs) and w
 ill feature students sharing how they've spent their summers\, including
  internships and other unique experiences. There will be an opportunity 
 for Q&A. At the end of the event\, you'll receive resources to help you 
 figure out your summer plans. Check back on this event towards the end O
 ctober to submit your questions before the event. This program is open t
 o all Princeton University undergraduates regardless of identity. Email 
 careerdevelopment@princeton.edu to request accommodations at least two w
 eeks prior to the program.\nRegister: https://princeton.joinhandshake.co
 m/edu/events/1979384\nhttps://careerdevelopment.princeton.edu/events/fir
 st-year-internship-summer-plans-panel
