SUMMARY:CIA Information Session
LOCATION:McCosh Hall 010
DESCRIPTION:We have a mission for you! The Central Intelligence Agency (C
 IA) Directorate of Operations (DO) is actively hiring students from all 
 backgrounds and majors to play an impactful role in promoting US nationa
 l security. They are seeking graduate students and seniors who have a de
 monstrated interest in foreign affairs (through coursework\, language st
 udy\, study abroad\, or travel) who are eager to serve their country. Sp
 ace permitting\, students will have the opportunity to connect with othe
 r undergraduates as well. Interested applicants attending the informatio
 n session will receive an event code for expedited hiring\, as well as b
 est practices for the application process. Prior to the Information Sess
 ion\, potential applicants are encouraged to visit cia.gov to become fam
 iliar with the CIA’s unique mission and cia.gov/careers (filtering by 
 the DO) to learn about DO careers. Applicants are requi\nAudience: Gradu
 ate Students\nRegister: https://princeton.joinhandshake.com/edu/events/2
 043909\nhttps://careerdevelopment.princeton.edu/events/cia-information-s
 ession-1
URL:https://careerdevelopment.princeton.edu/events/cia-information-sessio
 n-1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
