SUMMARY:Centerview Partners Info Session
LOCATION:Prospect House\, Garden Room
DESCRIPTION:Centerview Partners is a leading global investment banking ad
 visory firm with offices in New York\, London\, Paris\, Menlo Park and S
 an Francisco. Centerview’s summer analyst program offers a truly uniqu
 e and differentiated opportunity. In the independent advisory firm model
 \, summer analysts play a vital role on teams that are leaner than those
  of typical investment banks. As a result\, analysts should expect regul
 ar interaction with both senior Centerview professionals and clients. We
  are a flat organization that fosters thought leadership and has a stron
 g commitment to professional development.\nRegister: https://princeton.j
 oinhandshake.com/edu/events/2037007\nhttps://careerdevelopment.princeton
