LOCATION:Center for Career Development
DESCRIPTION:Join a coffee chat with the Central Intelligence Agency (CIA)
  Directorate of Operations (DO). (https://app.joinhandshake.com/edu/empl
 oyers/13164) The CIA is the world's premier intelligence organization\, 
 protecting the security of the Nation. The CIA looks for all academic ba
 ckgrounds and experiences to fill a variety of careers and student inter
 nships. Our people are patriotic\, collaborative\, driven\, creative\, a
 nd much more. Visit CIA.GOV/CAREERS to learn about opportunities to serv
 e your country. US citizenship (birthright\, naturalized\, or dual) is a
  requirement for employment with the CIA. This event is currently open t
 o seniors and graduate students. Students need toupload a resume visible
  to employers (https://support.joinhandshake.com/hc/en-us/articles/21869
 2648-How-to-Upload-a-New-Document) before registering for a coffee chat.
  If you want assistance updating your resume before th\nAudience: Gradua
 te Students\nRegister: https://princeton.joinhandshake.com/edu/events/20
 46438/overview\nhttps://careerdevelopment.princeton.edu/events/cia-coffe
 e-chat
